{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790407632994,"sessionID":"ses_f2365bd3fffeZxPNFfkYU8KZVD","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_RmxY2Xzd3XuiDLfCbqCISzZd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd"},"output":"<path>/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: extends Node2D\n2: \n3: const ARC_POINTS := 8\n4: \n5: @onready var area_2d: Area2D = $Area2D\n6: @onready var card_arc: Line2D = $CanvasLayer/CardArc\n7: \n8: var current_card: CardUI\n9: var targeting := false\n10: \n11: \n12: func _ready() -> void:\n13: \tEvents.card_aim_started.connect(_on_card_aim_started)\n14: \tEvents.card_aim_ended.connect(_on_card_aim_ended)\n15: \n16: \n17: func _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n18: \tif not targeting:\n19: \t\treturn\n20: \n21: \tarea_2d.position = get_local_mouse_position()\n22: \tcard_arc.points = _get_points()\n23: \n24: \n25: func _get_points() -> Array:\n26: \tvar points := []\n27: \tvar start := current_card.global_position\n28: \tstart.x += (current_card.size.x / 2)\n29: \tvar target := get_local_mouse_position()\n30: \tvar distance := (target - start)\n31: \t\n32: \tfor i in ARC_POINTS:\n33: \t\tvar t := (1.0 / ARC_POINTS) * i\n34: \t\tvar x := start.x + (distance.x / ARC_POINTS) * i\n35: \t\tvar y := start.y + ease_out_cubic(t) * distance.y\n36: \t\tpoints.append(Vector2(x, y))\n37: \t\n38: \tpoints.append(target)\n39: \t\n40: \treturn points\n41: \n42: \n43: func ease_out_cubic(number : float) -> float:\n44: \treturn 1.0 - pow(1.0 - number, 3.0)\n45: \n46: \n47: func _on_card_aim_started(card: CardUI) -> void:\n48: \tif not card.card.is_single_targeted():\n49: \t\treturn\n50: \t\n51: \ttargeting = true\n52: \tarea_2d.monitoring = true\n53: \tarea_2d.monitorable = true\n54: \tcurrent_card = card\n55: \n56: \n57: func _on_card_aim_ended(_card: CardUI) -> void:\n58: \ttargeting = false\n59: \tcard_arc.clear_points()\n60: \tarea_2d.position = Vector2.ZERO\n61: \tarea_2d.monitoring = false\n62: \tarea_2d.monitorable = false\n63: \tcurrent_card = null\n64: \n65: \n66: func _on_area_2d_area_entered(area: Area2D) -> void:\n67: \tif not current_card or not targeting:\n68: \t\treturn\n69: \t\n70: \tif not current_card.targets.has(area):\n71: \t\tcurrent_card.targets.append(area)\n72: \n73: \n74: func _on_area_2d_area_exited(area: Area2D) -> void:\n75: \tif not current_card or not targeting:\n76: \t\treturn\n77: \t\n78: \tcurrent_card.targets.erase(area)\n\n(End of file - total 78 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"extends Node2D\n\nconst ARC_POINTS := 8\n\n@onready var area_2d: Area2D = $Area2D\n@onready var card_arc: Line2D = $CanvasLayer/CardArc\n\nvar current_card: CardUI\nvar targeting := false\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tEvents.card_aim_started.connect(_on_card_aim_started)\n\tEvents.card_aim_ended.connect(_on_card_aim_ended)\n\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not targeting:\n\t\treturn\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd","text":"extends Node2D\n\nconst ARC_POINTS := 8\n\n@onready var area_2d: Area2D = $Area2D\n@onready var card_arc: Line2D = $CanvasLayer/CardArc\n\nvar current_card: CardUI\nvar targeting := false\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tEvents.card_aim_started.connect(_on_card_aim_started)\n\tEvents.card_aim_ended.connect(_on_card_aim_ended)\n\n\nfunc _process(_delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not targeting:\n\t\treturn\n\n\tarea_2d.position = get_local_mouse_position()\n\tcard_arc.points = _get_points()\n\n\nfunc _get_points() -> Array:\n\tvar points := []\n\tvar start := current_card.global_position\n\tstart.x += (current_card.size.x / 2)\n\tvar target := get_local_mouse_position()\n\tvar distance := (target - start)\n\t\n\tfor i in ARC_POINTS:\n\t\tvar t := (1.0 / ARC_POINTS) * i\n\t\tvar x := start.x + (distance.x / ARC_POINTS) * i\n\t\tvar y := start.y + ease_out_cubic(t) * distance.y\n\t\tpoints.append(Vector2(x, y))\n\t\n\tpoints.append(target)\n\t\n\treturn points\n\n\nfunc ease_out_cubic(number : float) -> float:\n\treturn 1.0 - pow(1.0 - number, 3.0)\n\n\nfunc _on_card_aim_started(card: CardUI) -> void:\n\tif not card.card.is_single_targeted():\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\ttargeting = true\n\tarea_2d.monitoring = true\n\tarea_2d.monitorable = true\n\tcurrent_card = card\n\n\nfunc _on_card_aim_ended(_card: CardUI) -> void:\n\ttargeting = false\n\tcard_arc.clear_points()\n\tarea_2d.position = Vector2.ZERO\n\tarea_2d.monitoring = false\n\tarea_2d.monitorable = false\n\tcurrent_card = null\n\n\nfunc _on_area_2d_area_entered(area: Area2D) -> void:\n\tif not current_card or not targeting:\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tif not current_card.targets.has(area):\n\t\tcurrent_card.targets.append(area)\n\n\nfunc _on_area_2d_area_exited(area: Area2D) -> void:\n\tif not current_card or not targeting:\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tcurrent_card.targets.erase(area)","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":78,"totalLines":78,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd","time":{"start":1790407632960,"end":1790407632987}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0c7280c2e5eb2f85016ab773cec10887d1b6966048576bf8f6"}},"id":"prt_0dc9c683c001f2Sv5AK1JNEf6U","sessionID":"ses_f2365bd3fffeZxPNFfkYU8KZVD","messageID":"msg_0dc9bb6050011AqTBrQIsq0Cxe"}}
